Package: rharv
Title: Daily Water-Balance Simulation of Rainwater Harvesting Systems
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Artur Moises", "Goncalves Lourenco",
           email = "artur.lourenco@ifpb.edu.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates rainwater harvesting reservoirs with a daily
    water-balance (mass-balance) model. From a daily precipitation series it
    computes the captured volume, runs the reservoir balance and derives
    performance metrics and guarantee-based sizing values (constant demand,
    catchment area and reservoir capacity). The available-volume relation and
    the daily-simulation approach follow established references (e.g. Souza,
    2015; ABNT NBR 15527). Aimed at water-security analysis of buildings,
    especially in semi-arid regions.
